  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-Mec 301.14 “Person” means “person” as defined in RSA 153:27, XIII, namely, “an individual, a natural person.”\n\nSource. #10648, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 7-25-14, EXPIRES: 1-21-15; ss by #10761, INTERIM, eff 1-21-15, EXPIRES: 7-20-15; ss by #10847, eff 7-1-15 (from Saf-Mec 303.14)",
